    {
      "topic": "other",
      "text": "Honors Program in Art (optional, not evaluated here): open to seniors with at least a 3.00 overall GPA and 3.50 in the major. Students enroll in ARH 495 or ARS 495 for the project semester. Honors are conferred if completed with distinction and a 3.50 GPA in all art courses taken in the senior year."
    },
    {
      "topic": "other",
      "text": "Minors of particular interest to Studio Art majors: Digital Arts (DIA), Art History (ARH)."
